*Prior to [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]], Waverider Kuu's Evolved Form was named "Waverider Kuu γ".
*Prior to [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]], she could be obtained from the [[Gals of Summer (Removed Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer]] gacha event.
*Waverider Kuu's Normal Form has the [[wikipedia:Tan line|tan lines]] of the outfit she wears in her Evolved Form.
*Waverider Kuu, type γ's cup still says Gals of Summer despite said Gacha now being removed.
**The orange palm trees on the logo are now used in the [[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Blue Ocean]] logo, despite the fact that she's obtained from Gals of Summer Sunshine.

